WEBVTT

00:05:29.413 --> 00:05:32.663
Well, I didn't want to say I cried,
but that's what I did.

00:05:33.288 --> 00:05:35.454
With so much out of his control
in that moment,

00:05:35.746 --> 00:05:38.079
Aaron found a way to take some
of the control back.

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:40.996
Instead of focusing narrowly
on the mortgage industry,

00:05:41.329 --> 00:05:44.954
Aaron broadened his lens. He
found a part time job as

00:05:44.954 --> 00:05:48.704
a substitute teacher to pay the bills,
which was a resourceful move,

00:05:49.079 --> 00:05:51.913
an example of what psychologists
call being proactive.

00:05:52.913 --> 00:05:55.954
Be proactive can be really
annoying advice,

00:05:56.621 --> 00:05:59.621
it isn't about working harder or
taking the bull by the horns

00:05:59.621 --> 00:06:02.496
or whatever your nagging uncle
keeps telling you to do,